WEBVTT

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.080
What a lovely uniform.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.540
Still, I'm pretty surprised.
It's cute, and really suits you!<b></b>

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.500
Still, I'm pretty surprised.
Thank you.<b></b>

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.000
Who'd have thought Ilya was a girl.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.710
Her name's not Ilya, it's Irina.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.170
Oh, right.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.000
Irina must be a girl's name, I guess.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.920
Seems that way.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.500
Come on, you two.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.920
Class is about to start.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.920
Yes, ma'am.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.210
Mr. Kashiwagi.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.380
Your necktie's loose.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.670
It's important to look presentable. Okay?

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.790
Th-thanks.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:43.000
Damn! You're one lucky bastard!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.540
What's this about?

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.710
You know. What Ms. Mongfa just did.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:51.830
Ahh, if only she'd fix my necktie like that.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:55.540
What's with you? Are you that into her?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.250
You could say that.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:01.290
It's the dream, right? An older woman.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:06.460
I bet she'd take her time showing me the ropes,
and have me on the ropes by the end of it!

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:07.830
Let's get ready to rumble!

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.170
It's not just me, by the way.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.830
Ms. Mongfa has a lot of fans among the boys!

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.540
Boys are such simple creatures.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:17.330
Meaning what?

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:18.750
Honestly.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:23.500
Why go for old Mongfa when you have a spry
and chipper young model right here?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.000
That phrasing makes you sound anything but young.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:26.830
No way!

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:27.500
I loved your history lesson the other day.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:29.710
But I don't think Ms. Mongfa's
popularity is limited to the boys.
I loved your history lesson the other day.<b></b>

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.040
But I don't think Ms. Mongfa's
popularity is limited to the boys.
Teach, let's eat lunch together!<b></b>

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.080
Me too! Me too!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.250
I see what you mean.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:39.380
She's got that cool and capable lady vibe.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.630
Yummy.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.580
Drinking again?

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.130
I don't see a "cool and capable lady."

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.960
What was that?

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.000
Nothing!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.080
Hey, is booze really that tasty?

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.920
Let me have a little too.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.920
It's not for you, Amelia.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:05.170
And, Teach, exercise some moderation.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:06.540
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:10.630
The way you said that
while serving me bar snacks, Aoi...

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.420
I love you!

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.380
Love you, love you!

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:14.630
Teach!
She's totally wasted.<b></b>

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:15.170
She's totally wasted.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.130
Um, Teach...

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.000
What is it, Rina?

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.380
You're... sticking out.

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.710
Oh, you're right.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.830
Hey, Asahi! Fix it!

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.580
Do it yourself.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.380
I can't. My hands are full.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.460
Just put the booze down!

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:42.080
That cold answer...

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:44.130
gets you zero points!

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.960
Time for your punishment!

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.250
Yah!
Don't take advantage of the chaos to hug him!<b></b>

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.580
Don't take advantage of the chaos to hug him!

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.420
What's that? Jealous, are we?

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.580
Don't worry.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.000
I love you too, Karin.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.790
Hey, don't bring me into this.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.290
And you, of course, Rina.

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:03.380
And you, Aoi.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.540
And you, Amelia.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.880
I love you all!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:13.830
I love spending time with you all in this house.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.920
I love you... all.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.960
Welp, I should go to bed too.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:34.830
Huh?

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:41.330
How many times have I told you to cut this shit out?

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:42.540
Amelia!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.920
You?

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.750
You're coming with me.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:56.920
What?!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:09.960
I saw a streak of light

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:12.130
Was that the starting signal?

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.630
Ah, like a lightning bolt, my heart started racing

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.000
I'm out of control

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.250
It's like I'm not myself

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.630
I dream of hot, hot fingertips that want to touch you

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:23.920
I want to be near you

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.130
Not just see you from afar

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:29.630
Ah, I want you to call to me - call to me lovingly

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.040
Something's wrong with me

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.130
I'm changing into a different person

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:35.790
To a scary degree

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.750
Suddenly, the story is

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.790
Spinning? Stopping? I can't predict it!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:42.830
Starting now

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:48.170
I'll show you a new record of loving you more than loving you

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.040
It's no use running away

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.080
Love? Reason why!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.330
I don't know why

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.080
Why? I don't know!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.380
You, not just anyone, struck my heart

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.960
Rather than painful, it was a sweet impact

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:04.750
This encounter is just what I've been waiting for

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.380
Fall in love and fly

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.170
Even while falling, start flying

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.420
You, not just anyone, are who I want to embrace

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.330
The reason I'm closing my eyes

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.630
Is that there are words I want to hear

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.210
So say them... Say you love me!

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.380
Are you awake, brat?

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.750
You're the bait to lure her in.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:06:01.420
To think she's in Japan
to protect a dumb kid like you.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.630
Colonel Thunders! Intruder alert!

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:06.790
So she's here.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.960
All hands, head to the site of the explosion at once!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.420
Oh! Dear me!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.540
Teach?!

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.290
Jeez, Asahi! What a state you're in.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.460
What are you doing here?

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.670
I came to rescue you, of course.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.460
Hey! Why are you taking photos?!

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:34.170
Stop gawking and untie me!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:39.080
But you look so adorable. I can't help it.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.080
"Adorable."

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:46.330
Come on, you're a boy.
You can't stay sad forever.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.460
Here. Take these.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.290
T-Teach, what are these for?!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.880
It never hurts to be prepared, right?

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:54.960
Now, put this on.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:56.830
Let's move.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.960
Hey, that guy we passed...

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.750
He was like that when I got here.

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:11.420
Must have fallen asleep.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.210
"Fallen asleep"?

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:16.380
If he were in my class, I'd be telling him off,

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:18.830
but right now, it's lucky for us.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:23.130
Teach!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.330
Eek!

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.170
Awesome! You saved me!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.540
No, I just...

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:42.040
Eek! Stay away!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.670
Just what I'd expect from a boy!
So dependable!

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:58.000
W-well, I-I can do that much.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.960
Yup! I'll be counting on you!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.000
Well then, let's go, Teach.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.750
What do we do? It's not working.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:12.000
Looks like an error in the main system
has caused a partial power outage.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.710
We can only fix it in the control room.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:17.420
But where's the control room?

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.750
Wait a moment.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.750
Tenth floor. Just below this one.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.000
Huh? How do you know that?

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.670
Let's just head down there.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.130
We'll take the stairs.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.380
No luck. It's locked.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:37.630
What now?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:41.130
Don't worry. I have an idea.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.210
Heave-ho!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.830
Teach, I can't!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:45.960
I can't, I can't, I can't!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.630
You'll be fine. You're a boy, right?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.000
Hang in there!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.580
Do the next one with me.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.000
Y-yes, ma'am.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.420
And... go!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.290
There. You're fine, right?

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.380
T-Teach?

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.630
Hmm...

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.000
Yup. Looks like I can take care of it.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.210
You know how it works?

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:15.040
I am a teacher, after all.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.380
Do this here, and...

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.130
Yes! It's fixed!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.790
I-it can't be...

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:46.250
I've been expecting you, Bloody Tiger.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.420
Love Flops.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.880
Who are you?

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:59.670
Don't tell me you've forgotten, Bloody Tiger.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.500
"Bloody Tiger"?

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.710
Looks like you don't want that brat to know.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:12.040
The woman who was once so feared,
reduced to a laughingstock.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.040
What the...

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.290
Teach...

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:36.290
Once upon a time, there was an agent who struck terror
into the hearts of those of us from the underworld.

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:41.170
Countless organizations were destroyed at her hands.

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:44.880
They say a river of blood flowed in her wake.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:48.710
Codename: Bloody Tiger.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.170
That is the woman you see before you!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.290
Bai Mongfa!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:00.290
A few years ago,
my team was wiped out by this very woman.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:04.920
My ultimate task force, the West Coast Lightning!

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:09.420
But in a crash of thunder,
I rose up from the pit of hell!

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:12.000
To get my revenge on her!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.170
Do you see?

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:19.710
That woman is a dreadful beast
whose hands are stained with many people's blood.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.960
N-no way...

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.040
Asahi...

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:29.500
Now! Show the brat who you really are!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:38.670
Teach!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.380
No! Run away!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.330
But...

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.330
What's wrong?

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:46.960
Those aren't the skills you used
to wipe out my squad!

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:51.750
Teach!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:56.130
You leave me no choice.
I'll give you some encouragement.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.080
Meaning what?

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:01.500
You know very well.
I'll take what's most precious to you.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.130
Like you took mine from me.

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:05.630
Stop!

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:08.380
Say goodbye, boy.

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:09.750
I won't let you do that!

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.330
Teach!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:25.210
Dammit! Right now, you're a mere pussycat!

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:28.880
I can only exact my revenge
against Bloody Tiger herself!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:33.330
Where are those sharp fangs and claws
feared by organizations the world over?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.080
A-Asahi... The switch...

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.830
Please. Hit the switch!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.540
What use is that cheap trick now?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:53.750
What the...

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.210
Damn you! You can't have...

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.040
Asahi, this way!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:04.790
R-right!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.170
Curse you!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:10.540
It's no use. That string's made of a special alloy.

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.540
You'll never be able to break it.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.750
Now, let's go.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:16.040
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.920
Curse you, Bloody Tiger!

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.380
Asahi! You're hurt!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.960
Oh, you're right.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.670
But it's nothing serious.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:41.460
Don't say that.

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.170
Teach...

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:53.500
I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.080
It's just as that man said.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:01.210
I was destined for that life from birth.

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:06.710
It was all for my missions, of course.
In those days, I even thought it was right.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.920
But at some point, I suddenly thought...

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.460
"What am I doing?"

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:17.580
A life spent not building anything, only destroying.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.880
Always feeding a vicious circle of hatred.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.500
What would it ever amount to?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:28.670
So I left the organization
and chose my current line of work.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.500
The path of a teacher, building the future.

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.250
It was so much fun.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.630
The time I spent with everyone from school.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:43.210
Asahi, Aoi, Amelia, Rina, Karin...

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:46.750
The ordinary days
I spent with you all in that house...

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.750
were the first affection I ever felt.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:56.630
In my time with you all, you made me feel
like a real person for the first time.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.210
You taught me the true meaning of life.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.250
But today, that's all over.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:05.880
"Over"?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:10.500
Don't worry.

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:16.500
Whatever happens, I will keep you safe.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.830
Teach, are you okay?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.330
They're not done yet.
There are more up ahead.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.960
There's an emergency exit
at the back of the elevator.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:06.580
You should be able to escape through there.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.330
And you're coming too, right?

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.330
Go.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.630
I might be able to help somehow.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:20.500
Go!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.250
But!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:30.000
If you stick around, you'll get in my way.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.580
Asahi!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.040
No way.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.290
It can't be!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:42.000
Thanks to you, I was once lingering
at the brink of death,

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:45.330
but in exchange,
I obtained this super strong body.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:55.080
Playtime is over!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:18:01.250
I'm going to really take my time
settling the score with you.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:05.670
You're still such a bone-shakingly fine woman.

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:06.670
You sleazebag!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.670
Say whatever you want.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.250
Now, how shall I torment you?

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.630
Huh?

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:23.250
You're still alive?

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.040
Brat!

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.290
Asahi...

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.080
Get away from her!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.080
That won't work!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.580
Asahi!

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.460
M-my teacher...

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.790
Our precious family member...

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:42.330
I won't let you lay a hand on her!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:56.040
Guess you have a death wish.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.170
Run away!

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.170
Then die!

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:03.670
Why, you...

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.460
Now take this!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:10.580
Wha...

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:17.210
Th-this is... lotion!

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.460
That won't defeat me!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.380
Teach! Now!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.250
We... won.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.630
Class dismissed.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:49.790
Asahi.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.170
Teach...

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:53.040
Are you okay? You're not injured?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:57.040
I'm fine. Just a bit sticky and gross.

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.250
Jeez. Why did you come back?

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:04.040
I just thought... I can't go home without you.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.080
But I'm...

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.710
It doesn't matter what you did in the past.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:15.330
You're the teacher we know and love.
Part of our family.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.000
Yeah.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:20.540
Asahi!

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:22.880
Thank you.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.210
T-Teach! Can't breathe!

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:29.170
I'll die! I'm going to die!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.500
Let's go back, Teach. To our home.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.500
Everyone'll be waiting.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.380
Yeah.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:52.040
Hey, get up already!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.500
Can't you hear me?

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.830
If you just lie there, you'll shrivel up.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.290
Come on already!

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:05.710
Okay. Coast is clear.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:08.580
I'm exhausted.

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:13.210
And hungry too. I need something to eat.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.500
Wh...

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.580
Wh-wh-wh...

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.830
Wh-wh-wh...!

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.960
What's all the fuss?

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:24.960
Karin?

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.460
Is something wrong?

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:29.040
L-look.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.250
A-Asahi!

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:36.960
Ms. Mongfa?

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.210
Teach...

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:42.080
Oh, Asahi, you're all slippery.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:44.210
Wh-what the hell happened here?!

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:45.080
They're post-deed.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.290
H-hold on!

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:48.460
You two get away from each other right now!

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.580
Five more minutes.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:55.580
In fact, why are you all slippery
like that anyway?!

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:00.210
I wonder what form it will take

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.880
I don't know the correct answer

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:05.670
That's right - I have to find

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.710
A love just for me

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:17.170
What kind of future should I draw?

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.670
I don't mind if it's hard to understand

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:22.710
That's right - because it's with you

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:25.630
Hey, I want to know love

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:28.540
I don't think I can hold back

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:31.290
The pounding of my heart

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.540
Will you accept it?

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:39.420
Go on, grab my heart and hold tight

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:42.290
Make a miracle occur

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:47.670
Your eyes may be spinning, but I won't give up

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:50.670
Come on, why? Tell me

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:53.670
Tell me your true feelings

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:59.000
Grab hold of our shining adolescence

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:10.460
It's me that'll be number one

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:13.380
Whatever form it takes

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:16.380
The right answer is up to me

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:19.330
I'm sure I'll find

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.040
A love just for me

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:26.500
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:27.420
Let's have s*x!

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:28.290
Urk!

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:30.380
You and Mon-chan had a suspicious vibe earlier.

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:31.290
C-calm down!

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.380
This time it's not a banana, right?

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:35.290
Next time, episode 6:

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>No Balls! N-No Dick Either...</b>

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:38.710
"No Balls! N-No Dick Either..."

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:40.710
Is it okay to snooze the alarm?
